exports[`frozen CLI descriptor and help graph snapshots root, every group, and every command help form 21`] = `
"Usage
  explodex plugin <command> [arguments] [options]

Description
  Plugin authoring, artifacts, lifecycle, and registry operations.

Commands
  create                Create a safe generated-only plugin workspace.
  validate              Validate a plugin workspace source contract.
  build                 Build browser-safe plugin artifacts into dist/.
  package               Package a validated plugin artifact archive.
  artifact validate     Validate a standalone packaged plugin artifact.
  install               Atomically install a prebuilt plugin archive disabled and pending review.
      Aliases: add
  status                Show installed, pending, and enabled plugin state.
  refresh               Discover installed plugins and present pending review when required.
  review                Present metadata-only review for pending plugins.
  update check          Check for available plugin updates without applying them.
  update apply          Apply selected plugin updates after review.
  disable               Disable an installed plugin without removing its bytes.
  remove                Remove an installed plugin identity.
  develop               Foreground plugin build/watch against the exact owned development instance.

Shared options
  See global options: explodex --help

Examples
  explodex plugin create

More information
  explodex help plugin <command>
  explodex plugin <command> --help
"
`;

