  explodex plugin install [archive] [--registry <id>] [--github-url <url>] [--archive-sha256 <hex>] [--payload-sha256 <hex>] [--target <role>]

Summary
  Atomically install a prebuilt plugin archive disabled and pending review.
  Aliases: add

Arguments
  archive         Local prebuilt .tar.gz or .tgz plugin archive. (optional)

Options
      --registry <id>
      Install an exact plugin ID from the configured registry.
      --github-url <url>
      Install from one canonical immutable GitHub release URL.
      --archive-sha256 <hex>
      Expected lowercase SHA-256 of exact archive bytes.
      --payload-sha256 <hex>
      Optional expected lowercase canonical payload SHA-256.
      --target <role>
      Review target role; unavailable targets leave the install disabled and pending. (values: none|main|development; default: none)
  Global options are accepted anywhere before --; see explodex --help.

Output
  Human mode writes the primary result to stdout and diagnostics to stderr.
  --json writes one schemaVersion-1 envelope to stdout.

Exit status
  0 success, 1 operational failure, 2 usage error, 3 blocked, 4 busy, 5 timeout, 130 interrupted

Examples
  explodex plugin install [archive] [--registry <id>] [--github-url <url>] [--archive-sha256 <hex>] [--payload-sha256 <hex>] [--target <role>]
  explodex --json plugin install [archive] [--registry <id>] [--github-url <url>] [--archive-sha256 <hex>] [--payload-sha256 <hex>] [--target <role>]
"
`;

