exports[`frozen CLI descriptor and help graph snapshots root, every group, and every command help form 53`] = `
"Usage
  explodex dev <command> [arguments] [options]

Description
  One persistent isolated development instance on 127.0.0.1:9444.

Commands
  status                Check health, ownership, crash state, and the next safe action.
  start                 Start the stopped development instance once.
  ensure                Reuse, safely recover if confirmed dead, or start the development instance once.
  recover               Explicitly recover a failed or interrupted development record.
  inject                Inject an artifact into the owned development instance.
  restart               Restart only the exact owned development process once.
  stop                  Stop only the exact owned development process.
  focus                 Focus the owned development instance when exact process-specific activation is supported.

Shared options
  See global options: explodex --help

Examples
  explodex dev status

More information
  explodex help dev <command>
  explodex dev <command> --help
"
`;

